  <Contents>
    <Layer>
      <ows:Title>Dark sky: sky above 30°, candidate sites</ows:Title>
      <ows:Abstract>Modelled mean V-band sky brightness over the sky above 30° elevation (mag/arcsec²), including local light sources and direct glare from lamps in view. Shown only where terrain stays below 10° over at least 75 % of the horizon, at least 200 m from any building, less than 50 % forest, and artificial light at most 2× the natural sky. Darker blue = darker sky. Model output (VIIRS 2025, calibrated to the Lorenz 2025 atlas), not a measurement. github.com/KillianBrennan/dark_sky</ows:Abstract>
      <ows:WGS84BoundingBox><ows:LowerCorner>6.52151 46.31765</ows:LowerCorner><ows:UpperCorner>8.38231 47.58070</ows:UpperCorner></ows:WGS84BoundingBox>
      <ows:Identifier>darksky_allsky30</ows:Identifier>
      <Style isDefault="true"><ows:Identifier>default</ows:Identifier>
        <LegendURL format="image/png" xlink:href="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/KillianBrennan/dark_sky/main/outputs/legend_3_allsky30.png"/></Style>
      <Format>image/png</Format>
      <TileMatrixSetLink><TileMatrixSet>lv95_darksky</TileMatrixSet></TileMatrixSetLink>
      <ResourceURL format="image/png" resourceType="tile" template="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/KillianBrennan/dark_sky/main/outputs/wmts/darksky_allsky30/{TileMatrix}/{TileRow}/{TileCol}.png"/>
    </Layer>
    <Layer>
      <ows:Title>Dark sky: sky above 30°, everywhere</ows:Title>
      <ows:Abstract>Modelled mean V-band sky brightness over the sky above 30° elevation (mag/arcsec²), including local light sources and direct glare, for every pixel (no site masks). The lightest class is brighter than the candidate-site threshold (artificial &gt; 2× natural). Darker blue = darker sky. Model output, not a measurement. github.com/KillianBrennan/dark_sky</ows:Abstract>
      <ows:WGS84BoundingBox><ows:LowerCorner>6.52151 46.31765</ows:LowerCorner><ows:UpperCorner>8.38231 47.58070</ows:UpperCorner></ows:WGS84BoundingBox>
      <ows:Identifier>darksky_allsky30_unmasked</ows:Identifier>
      <Style isDefault="true"><ows:Identifier>default</ows:Identifier>
        <LegendURL format="image/png" xlink:href="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/KillianBrennan/dark_sky/main/outputs/legend_3b_allsky30_unmasked.png"/></Style>
      <Format>image/png</Format>
      <TileMatrixSetLink><TileMatrixSet>lv95_darksky</TileMatrixSet></TileMatrixSetLink>
      <ResourceURL format="image/png" resourceType="tile" template="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/KillianBrennan/dark_sky/main/outputs/wmts/darksky_allsky30_unmasked/{TileMatrix}/{TileRow}/{TileCol}.png"/>
    </Layer>
